.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>Figure 1.  Correct geotextile placement for current acting parallel to bank 
or for wave attack on the bank.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>Figure 2.  Placement of geotextile on bank subject to streamflow action.  Revetment 
